<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I know that my Redeemer lives,</l><l>A quick’ning Spirit He;</l><l>I know eternal life He gives—</l><l>Amazing grace—to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I find Him lifting up my head;</l><l>He brings salvation near;</l><l>His presence makes me free indeed,</l><l>And He will soon appear.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>He wills that I should holy be:</l><l>What can withstand His will?</l><l>The counsel of His grace in me</l><l>He surely shall fulfill.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus, I hang upon Thy word:</l><l>I steadfastly believe</l><l>Thou wilt return and claim me, Lord,</l><l>And to Thyself receive.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
